        "value": "Running page-header in the outer (right) margin: Domain Survey Table, ninth fascicle (Fukui). The nine 藩制一覧表 fascicles are numbered registers, not data themes; fascicles 8-9 are the officials + military register. This header names Fukui because Fukui's entry STARTS on this page at the ○福井藩 marker, but the officials/military data printed here is the preceding domain (Fukuoka). Provenance, not domain data."
